[h1]AGOT - Province Window Redux[/h1]

A reworked holding view for A Game of Thrones.

A version for the base game is available: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446660316]Province Window Redux[/url].

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Expanding building grid[/b]: the building slots fill the middle of the window, and the grid grows as the holding gains slots.
[*][b]Add a Building Slot[/b]: buy an extra building slot for a holding (1,500 gold).
[*][b]Swap Holding Type[/b]: turn a holding into a castle, temple or city (2,500 gold).
[*][b]Take Flight[/b]: dragonriders can fly straight to a province from its holding view.
[*]Keeps AGOT's settlement buttons and layout.
[*]Holdings can have up to 100 building slots.
[/list]

[h2]Works With[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3446353510]AGOT - Secrets of the Higher Mysteries[/url]: with the Mystery Casting map mode on, clicking a province opens the Mysteries window aimed at it.
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3497141119]AGOT - Colonisation Mechanic[/url]: adds a colonise button to the holding view.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Replaces [b]gui/window_county_view.gui[/b], so it is incompatible with other mods that edit the holding view. Load it low in your mod list, after AGOT.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Bug reports and suggestions are always welcome.
